-- 7ARF ETEGAH MESTAKHABI ------------------------------ main.franco.kl  SEC0110

La2eit U+202E (RIGHT-TO-LEFT OVERRIDE). Da beyghayar shakl el satr men gher ma yghayar el code nafso, w di fekret hagamat Trojan Source. El kalam el 3arabi mesh me7tago khales.

8│     khali xs = [1, 2, 3]  # ‮reversed
                               ^

Mosa3da: Emsa7o. W law string me7tago bgad, ektebo escape `\u{...}` 3ashan elly beye2ra yshofo.

